            "content": "<p>We offer fast and reliable shipping for all our items.</p><p>For any questions regarding your order, please contact our customer service team for assistance at hello@lecavist.com or <a href=\"tel:+61293989933\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:+61293989933\">02 9398 9933</a></p>",
