        "collapsible_row_VKx8Qq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Specifications",
            "content": "<p><strong>8 Pull-out Wire Racks with Beech Wood Lids</strong>: Conveniently display and access your bottles with these easy-to-pull racks, offering a premium aesthetic while reducing vibration.</p><p><strong>Intelligent Humidity and Temperature Control</strong>: Maintain perfect storage conditions with precise control over both temperature and humidity levels, ensuring your wine stays in ideal conditions.</p><p><strong>Carbon Filter</strong>: Purifies the air inside the fridge, keeping your collection fresh and free from unwanted odors.</p><p><strong>Multi-Airflow Fan</strong>: Ensures even air circulation, keeping the temperature consistent across the entire fridge and eliminating any hot or cold spots.</p><p><strong>Cold LED Lighting</strong>: Elegant and energy-efficient LED lights provide a gentle glow, highlighting your wine collection without generating heat.</p><p><strong>Triple Layer Low-E Coated Tempered Glass Door</strong>: The advanced glass protects your wine from harmful UV rays while maintaining insulation to preserve ideal storage conditions.</p><p><strong>Three Separate Temperature Zones</strong>: Perfect for storing different wine varietals at their ideal serving temperatures, all in one fridge:</p><p><strong>Upper Zone</strong>: 8 - 13°C</p><p><strong>Lower Zone</strong>: 13 - 18°C</p><p><strong>Drawer</strong>: 1 - 8°C</p><p><strong>Freestanding Design</strong>: The fridge is easy to install with no plumbing or professional setup required. Simply place it on a flat surface and plug it into a standard power outlet.</p>",
            "use_product_description": false
          }
        },
